name: Tess
title: Nuclear technology teacher
field: nuclear-technology

bio:
    I'm Tess! I teach how nuclear tools help in hospitals, farms and factories. I love a good gadget. Short lessons, quick answers, and you can be on to the next one before I finish this sentence!

